Go dtí an ceann de chóid HTML & CSS a bheith in ann capall Traíoch (ciorc) a chruthú le cuma aip dhlisteanach (radial gradient), sin an méid is féidir liom a thabhairt duit:

### HTML
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ga">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Capall Tríoch</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="circle"></div>
</body>
</html>
```

### CSS (style.css)
```css
body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    background-color: #ccc; /* Cúma scátháin */
}

.circle {
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, white 0%, #4A90E2 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
}
```

---

### Tionscadh:
- **HTML** cruthann `div` neamhshuíomh a bheith in ann an ciorc a bheith.
- **CSS** dáilt:
  - `width` agus `height` dírítear an méid a bheith in ann an ciorc a bheith.
  - `border-radius: 50%` cruthann ciorc.
  - `radial-gradient` cruthann cuma aip dhlisteanach. Sín an úsáid `circle at center` chun an cuma aip a dhéanamh ciorc. Is féidir leat an t-alt a athrú (e.g., `ellipse`).
  - `box-shadow` cruthann scáthán leis an capall tríoch.

### Athruithe:
- **Cúma aip dhlisteanach** is féidir leat an `radial-gradient` a athrú chun cúmanta aip eile a úsáid. Mar shampla:
  ```css
  background: radial-gradient(circle at center, yellow 0%, orange 50%, red 100%);
  ```

